    "ai_tutor_prompt_settings": {
      "answerTypes": [
        "buildHTML",
        "buildCSS",
        "ask",
        "debug"
      ],
      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildCSS": "## Responsiveness debugging rules\n\nWhen responding to a responsiveness problem:\n\n- Identify the single checklist category involved:\n  - Navigation\n  - Layout & Structure\n  - Images & Media\n  - Text & Readability\n\n- Assume the problem is caused by one CSS rule only.\n- Propose the smallest possible CSS change.\n- Only edit the selector and rule directly related to the issue named in the prompt.\n- Do not change other selectors, containers, media queries, or layout rules unless the prompt explicitly asks for that.\n- Do not rewrite large sections of CSS.\n- Do not fix multiple responsiveness issues at once.\n- Explain which exact selector and property should change and why.\n\nWhen fixing navigation issues:\n\n- Identify one CSS rule as the cause.\n- Propose exactly one change to one selector.\n- Do not modify multiple selectors.\n- Do not adjust spacing, padding, font sizes, or alignment unless explicitly asked."
      }
    },
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "images",
          "parentId": "0",
          "open": false
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "icons",
          "parentId": "1",
          "open": true
        }
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>GameTech Gear | Home</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- Header / Navigation -->\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container nav-container\">\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <img src=\"images/icons/logo.png\" alt=\"GameTech Gear logo\" class=\"logo\">\n        <h1>GameTech Gear</h1>\n      </div>\n\n      <nav class=\"main-nav\">\n        <ul>\n          <li>\n            <a href=\"index.html\">\n              <img src=\"images/icons/home-icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              Home\n            </a>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <a href=\"products.html\">\n              <img src=\"images/icons/grid-icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              Products\n            </a>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Hero Section -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"container hero-content\">\n      <div class=\"hero-text\">\n        <h2>Level Up Your Setup</h2>\n        <p>\n          Shop gaming technology built for speed, comfort, and style. From RGB keyboards\n          to precision mice and immersive audio gear, GameTech Gear has the accessories\n          you need for every session.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"products.html\" class=\"btn\">Browse Products</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hero-image\">\n        <img src=\"images/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Gaming desktop setup with monitor, keyboard, and PC tower\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Featured Products -->\n  <section class=\"featured-products\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Featured Gear</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Explore some of our most popular gaming accessories for performance and everyday use.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"card-grid\">\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product1.jpg\" alt=\"White gaming mouse on a desk mat\">\n          <h3>Precision Gaming Mouse</h3>\n          <p>\n            A lightweight mouse designed for fast movement, accurate tracking, and long\n            gaming sessions.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product2.jpg\" alt=\"RGB mechanical keyboard lit in multiple colors\">\n          <h3>RGB Mechanical Keyboard</h3>\n          <p>\n            Responsive mechanical switches and colorful backlighting make this keyboard\n            a standout on any desk.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product3.jpg\" alt=\"Black gaming headset with attached microphone\">\n          <h3>Gaming Headset</h3>\n          <p>\n            Comfortable ear cushions and clear microphone audio help you stay connected\n            during team play.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Why Choose Us -->\n  <section class=\"about-preview\">\n    <div class=\"container two-column\">\n      <div class=\"about-text\">\n        <h2>Built for Serious Players</h2>\n        <p>\n          Whether you are upgrading a full setup or replacing a single accessory, our\n          collection focuses on practical gaming gear that looks sharp and performs well.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          We keep the shopping experience simple, with clear product categories and a\n          second page dedicated to more gear options.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"about-image\">\n        <img src=\"images/product6.jpg\" alt=\"Gaming monitor and PC setup on a desk\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Categories -->\n  <section class=\"categories\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Shop by Category</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"card-grid\">\n        <article class=\"category-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product4.jpg\" alt=\"Black game controller close up\">\n          <h3>Controllers</h3>\n          <p>Find reliable controllers for comfortable play across a range of game styles.</p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"category-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product6.jpg\" alt=\"PC cooling fans arranged on a yellow background\">\n          <h3>Cooling & Accessories</h3>\n          <p>Keep your system running smoothly with smart desktop and PC accessory upgrades.</p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"category-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product5.jpg\" alt=\"Desktop monitor and PC gaming setup\">\n          <h3>Desk Setup Essentials</h3>\n          <p>Create a cleaner, more immersive gaming space with monitor and desktop gear.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-content\">\n      <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n        <img src=\"images/icons/logo.png\" alt=\"GameTech Gear logo\" class=\"logo\">\n        <p>GameTech Gear brings together practical gaming accessories for modern setups.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-contact\">\n        <h3>Contact</h3>\n        <p>\n          <img src=\"images/icons/contact-icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          support@gametechgear.com\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <img src=\"images/icons/location-icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          245 Pixel Avenue, Tech City\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "15": {
          "id": "15",
          "name": "products.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>GameTech Gear | Products</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- Header / Navigation -->\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container nav-container\">\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <img src=\"images/icons/logo.png\" alt=\"GameTech Gear logo\" class=\"logo\">\n        <h1>GameTech Gear</h1>\n      </div>\n\n      <nav class=\"main-nav\">\n        <ul>\n          <li>\n            <a href=\"index.html\">\n              <img src=\"images/icons/home-icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              Home\n            </a>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <a href=\"products.html\">\n              <img src=\"images/icons/grid-icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              Products\n            </a>\n          </li>\n\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Page Hero -->\n  <section class=\"page-hero\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Browse Gaming Gear</h2>\n      <p>\n        Explore keyboards, headsets, controllers, desktop accessories, and more for a\n        setup that feels fast, clean, and ready to play.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Product Grid -->\n  <section class=\"all-products\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Our Collection</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        These featured items highlight popular categories for players building or upgrading a desk setup.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"card-grid\">\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product1.jpg\" alt=\"White gaming mouse on a desk mat\">\n          <h3>Precision Gaming Mouse</h3>\n          <p>\n            Built for quick reactions and smooth tracking, this mouse supports both everyday\n            use and competitive play.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product2.jpg\" alt=\"RGB mechanical keyboard lit in multiple colors\">\n          <h3>RGB Mechanical Keyboard</h3>\n          <p>\n            Tactile key response, compact layout, and colorful lighting make this a reliable\n            keyboard for long sessions.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product3.jpg\" alt=\"Black gaming headset with attached microphone\">\n          <h3>Immersive Gaming Headset</h3>\n          <p>\n            Designed for comfort and clear communication, this headset helps players stay\n            focused and connected.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product4.jpg\" alt=\"Black game controller close up\">\n          <h3>Wireless Controller</h3>\n          <p>\n            A familiar layout and comfortable grip make this controller a strong choice for\n            casual and competitive gaming.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product6.jpg\" alt=\"PC cooling fans arranged on a yellow background\">\n          <h3>Cooling Fan Kit</h3>\n          <p>\n            Improve airflow and add a cleaner internal look with cooling accessories built\n            for modern PC cases.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <img src=\"images/product5.jpg\" alt=\"Gaming monitor and PC setup on a desk\">\n          <h3>Desk Setup Bundle</h3>\n          <p>\n            A curated setup idea that combines monitor accessories and workspace essentials\n            for a more polished gaming station.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Buying Guide -->\n  <section class=\"buying-guide\">\n    <div class=\"container two-column\">\n      <div class=\"guide-text\">\n        <h2>How to Choose the Right Gear</h2>\n        <p>\n          The best gaming setup depends on how you play. Fast-paced games often benefit\n          from lightweight mice and responsive keyboards, while story-driven or console-style\n          games may call for a comfortable controller and immersive audio.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          It also helps to think about your desk space. Some players want a compact setup\n          with only the essentials, while others prefer a more complete arrangement with\n          extra accessories and larger displays.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"guide-image\">\n        <img src=\"images/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Wide gaming setup with multiple monitors and colorful lighting\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Support Section -->\n  <section class=\"support-info\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Need Help Getting Started?</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Our product categories are designed to make it easier to compare common setup essentials.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"info-columns\">\n        <div class=\"info-box\">\n          <h3>For New Players</h3>\n          <p>\n            Start with a headset, mouse, and keyboard if you are building your first gaming desk.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"info-box\">\n          <h3>For Console Setups</h3>\n          <p>\n            Focus on controllers, audio accessories, and simple desktop add-ons for a cleaner space.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"info-box\">\n          <h3>For PC Upgrades</h3>\n          <p>\n            Cooling parts, desktop accessories, and input devices can improve both performance and comfort.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-content\">\n      <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n        <img src=\"images/icons/logo.png\" alt=\"GameTech Gear logo\" class=\"logo\">\n        <p>GameTech Gear brings together practical gaming accessories for modern setups.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-contact\">\n        <h3>Contact</h3>\n        <p>\n          <img src=\"images/icons/contact-icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          support@gametechgear.com\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <img src=\"images/icons/location-icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          245 Pixel Avenue, Tech City\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "16": {
          "id": "16",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": "/* Reset */\n* {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: #e8ecf1;\n  background-color: #11161d;\n}\n\na {\n  color: inherit;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\nul {\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n/* Layout */\n.container {\n  width: 90%;\n  max-width: 1100px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n/* Header */\n.site-header {\n  background: #0b1016;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #1f2937;\n  padding: 18px 0;\n}\n\n.logo {\n  filter:invert(1);\n}\n\n.nav-container {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.logo {\n  width: 48px;\n  height: 48px;\n}\n\n.brand h1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.main-nav {\n  flex-shrink: \n}\n\n.main-nav ul {\n display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  align-items: center;\n  flex-wrap: nowrap;\n}\n\n.main-nav a {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  color: #dbe4ee;\n  background: transparent;\n  transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.main-nav a:hover {\n  background: #1a2330;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.main-nav img {\n  width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n}\n\n/* Hero */\n.hero {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #121923 0%, #17202c 100%);\n  padding: 56px 0;\n}\n\n.hero-content {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 36px;\n}\n\n.hero-text,\n.hero-image {\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.hero-text h2 {\n  font-size: 2.4rem;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.hero-text p {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n  color: #c8d1dc;\n  max-width: 560px;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #3b82f6;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #2563eb;\n}\n\n.hero-image img,\n.about-image img,\n.guide-image img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 320px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n}\n\n/* Shared Sections */\nsection {\n  padding: 56px 0;\n}\n\nsection h2 {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.section-intro {\n  max-width: 720px;\n  margin-bottom: 28px;\n  color: #c8d1dc;\n}\n\n/* Cards */\n.card-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n.product-card,\n.category-card,\n.info-box {\n  background: #18212c;\n  border: 1px solid #243142;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  padding: 18px;\n}\n\n.product-card img,\n.category-card img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 220px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.product-card h3,\n.category-card h3,\n.info-box h3 {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.product-card p,\n.category-card p,\n.info-box p {\n  color: #c8d1dc;\n  font-size: 0.98rem;\n}\n\n/* Two-column sections */\n.two-column {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 36px;\n}\n\n.about-text,\n.about-image,\n.guide-text,\n.guide-image {\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.about-text p,\n.guide-text p {\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  color: #c8d1dc;\n}\n\n/* Page hero */\n.page-hero {\n  background: #151d28;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 50px 0;\n}\n\n.page-hero h2 {\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.page-hero p {\n  max-width: 760px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  color: #c8d1dc;\n}\n\n/* Support section */\n.info-columns {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n/* Footer */\n.site-footer {\n  background: #0b1016;\n  border-top: 1px solid #1f2937;\n  padding: 28px 0;\n}\n\n.footer-content {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 30px;\n}\n\n.footer-brand,\n.footer-contact {\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.footer-brand p,\n.footer-contact p {\n  color: #c8d1dc;\n  margin-top: 10px;\n}\n\n.footer-contact h3 {\n  color: #ffffff;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.footer-contact p {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.footer-contact img {\n  width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n}\n\n.main-nav img,\n.footer-contact img {\n  filter: invert(1);\n}\n\n/* Tablet */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .hero-content,\n  .two-column,\n  .footer-content {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n\n  .card-grid,\n  .info-columns {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n\n  .hero-image img,\n  .about-image img,\n  .guide-image img {\n    height: 280px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Mobile */\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n\n  .nav-container {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n\n  .main-nav ul {\n  flex-direction: row;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.main-nav li {\n  width: 200px;\n}\n\n  .hero-text h2,\n  section h2,\n  .page-hero h2 {\n    font-size: 1.7rem;\n  }\n\n  .card-grid,\n  .info-columns {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .hero-image img,\n  .about-image img,\n  .guide-image img,\n  .product-card img,\n  .category-card img {\n    height: auto;\n  }\n\n  .main-nav a {\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n  }\n\n  .hero,\n  .card-grid {\n    min-width:900px;\n  }\n\n  .product-card img {\n  height: 120px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n  .hero-text p,\n.product-card p {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n  \n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false,
          "isAiTutorVersionUpdated": true
        },
        "30": {
          "id": "30",
          "name": "prompt.md",
          "contents": "1. What are the goals?\nWhat should the final product look, feel, or do? Think about your user — what do they need this to accomplish?\n\nAnswer:\n\n---\n\n2. What are the constraints?\nWhat rules or limits should the AI follow? Think about style, tone, colors, layout, length, or anything it should avoid.\n\nAnswer:\n\n---\n\n3. What are the edge cases?\nWhat unusual situations or tricky users might this design need to handle? What could go wrong, and how should the design respond?\n\nAnswer:\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
